# Force LF line endings for shell scripts (git hooks must not have CRLF)
.githooks/* text eol=lf

# Firebase 桌面（Editor beta）核心原生库：单文件超 GitHub 100MB 限制（.bundle 181M / .so 111M），改由 Git LFS 承载。
# .dll（14M）未超限，为三平台版本对齐一并纳入 LFS 统一管理。
/UPMPackages/com.solotopia.nova.framework.sdk.firebase/Firebase/Plugins/x86_64/FirebaseCppApp-*.bundle filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
/UPMPackages/com.solotopia.nova.framework.sdk.firebase/Firebase/Plugins/x86_64/FirebaseCppApp-*.so filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
/UPMPackages/com.solotopia.nova.framework.sdk.firebase/Firebase/Plugins/x86_64/FirebaseCppApp-*.dll filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
